CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentIntroDesc	<b>Welcome!</b> This tool can be used to plan a transition to Financial Services Cloud and identify dependency conflicts and potential key points of resistance when going through the transition. Please take the time to fill out an Assessment, or resume an already in-progress assessment below.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentIntroTitle	Financial Services Cloud Transition Assistant
CustomLabel.omnistudio__AssessmentNotSelected	Not Selected
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentOptionalDisclaimer	<b>Please note that while all answers within the assessment are optional, the accuracy of the results from the report may vary greatly if questions are not answered. We encourage you to answer all portions of the assessment to the best of your ability.</b>
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentPersonAccountNotice	When operating with a B2C model, it is highly recommended that you use Person Accounts for your customers. For more information on Person Accounts, please refer to the following documentation: <a target="_blank" href="https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.account_person.htm&type=5">https://help.salesforce.com/articleView?id=sf.account_person.htm&type=5</a>
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep1Desc	Select the LOB's relevant to your organization, if they are to be represented in Salesforce
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep1Name	Lines of Business
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep2Desc	Provide some basic information to enhance the accuracy of your transition report
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep2Name	Questionnaire
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep3Desc	Automate the transfer of record data to comply with new metadata model
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentProgressStep3Name	Mapping
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentQuestionRequiredText	Based on your current selection an answer to this question is required before completing the assessment.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportDataVolumesText	Data Volumes can effect complexity of the transition project, careful planning is suggested for Orgs with over 10 million records. Additional information about best practices handling large data volumes can be found <a href="https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.salesforce_large_data_volumes_bp.meta/salesforce_large_data_volumes_bp/ldv_deployments_introduction.htm">here</a>. Use of professional services and Enterprise ETL tools is highly recommended
