CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportIrreversibleFSCSettingsText	Beyond the pre-configured settings, Financial Services Cloud provides advanced capabilities to customize the functionality to your specific requirements.  Some of these settings are irreversable.  It is therefore essential that these choices are made carefully. All advanced customizations are explained in the <a href="https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.financial_services_cloud_admin_guide.meta/financial_services_cloud_admin_guide/fsc_admin_impl_design_considerations.htm">admin guide for Financial Services Cloud.</a> We recommend that you consult the admin guide before changing the default settings. If you still have questions after consulting the admin guide, please contact your Salesforce partner or Salesforce support.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportIrreversibleFSCSettingsTitle	Financial Services Cloud
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportIrreversibleInsuranceSettingsText	Some settings for Financial Services Cloud are irreversible. Therefore, it is very important to consult the specific documentation <a href="https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.financial_services_cloud_admin_guide.meta/financial_services_cloud_admin_guide/fsc_insurance_admin_setup.htm">"Set Up Insurance for Financial Services Cloud"</a> to ensure that the right choices are made.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportIrreversibleInsuranceSettingsTitle	Insurance
