CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportSectionSummaryAnalysis	Here's a technical analysis showing all the customizations in this org that can be easily replaced with the transition to FSC. This section also indicates the customizations that will require a more thorough review by an architect or developer for the transition, such as any custom code you may have.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportSectionSummaryResults	Here is a high-level view of how FSC features and customizations can be approached for migration. Use this information to create the first draft of your gap analysis. To get a closer look, click the link for each feature or customization for recommendations for specific changes. But remember: You're the Salesforce expert at your company. Leverage the usage data in each section to decide whether our recommendations are worth your effort. For example, if the report identifies AppExchange packages require a thoughtful rollout but no one is using them, cross that feature off your gap analysis.
