CustomLabel.FSCTransition__AssessmentReportWelcomeText	<br/><br/>\n<b>\n          This document outlines the recommendations for the transition to Financial Services Cloud (FSC). This document is meant for existing Sales and Service Cloud customers who are looking to implement FSC. Customers with other license types may have additional changes to take care of. Please review the recommendations and items reported below, and assess the business impact of accommodating these recommendations before proceeding to package creation/installation.\n            </b>
