CustomLabel.omnistudio__DeployingMessage	Deploying LWC
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistCompactLayout	The selected Compact Layouts will be deployed to the target FSC object and will only include fields that were mapped during the mapping process. The original fields in the source layouts will be replaced with the target fields defined in the mapping. If no fields were mapped then the Compact Layout will deploy without fields.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistCustomField	These are the custom fields that were introduced during the mapping process of the assessment and will be deployed as new fields to the target FSC object
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistDescription	Below are components that can be automatically migrated over to the Financial Services Cloud data model. This includes new custom fields or record types that were introduced in the mapping process and any existing components related to the mapped objects that can be transferred to the target FSC objects. Select which components you wish to migrate and click Generate Deployment Package to create a package available for deployment. Use the Deploy Packages tab to view generated packages and deploy to this org or another.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistDescriptionEmpty	There are no custom components detected that are related to the objects that were selected in the mapping process of the transition assessment. This page will display any supported components that can be automatically migrated and are mapped to a new target FSC object. Review the Migration Analysis section of the generated report for more details on the customizations that will impact FSC transition.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistEmailTemplate	The selected Email Templates will be copied to new templates with all source object and field references replaced with the target mapped objects and fields. Any merge fields that were not mapped will be copied over as-is and will require further review and manual updates.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistFieldSet	The selected Field Sets will be deployed to the target FSC object and will only include fields that were mapped during the mapping process. The original fields in the source field sets will be replaced with the target fields defined in the mapping. If no fields were mapped then the Field Set will deploy without fields.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistPageLayout	The selected Page Layouts will be deployed to the target FSC object and will only include fields that were mapped during the mapping process. The original fields in the source layouts will be replaced with the target fields defined in the mapping. If no fields were mapped then the Page Layout will deploy without fields.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistPermissionSet	Permission Sets can be updated with permissions copied from source to destination objects. Due to the way Permission Sets are deployed, the generated change can only be deployed into this organization and cannot be copied to another organization because the Permission Set file includes all permissions which can reference objects that don't exist in another org.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistProfile	Object CRUD and Field Level Security will be copied from source objects to target objects defined in the mapping. Record Type and Page Layout assignments will also be copied. Permissions will only be set for target objects defined in the mapping.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistRelationships	The items in this list are Custom Fields will be deployed as a new version of the field on the existing child object pointing to the new target parent object. The original field will require manual review by an expert to migrate any remaining references and populated data to the new field before deleting the old field. Below are some limitations for generating changes for these components and can cause a deployment error:<br/><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>Lookup fields that are added cannot exceed object max limit of Lookup relationships.</li>\n<li>Master-Detail fields that are added cannot exceed object max limit of 2 relationships. Child records will keep the sharing rules inherited from the original parent until re-parented to the new target FSC object and legacy field is deleted.</li>\n<li>If moving these changes to a new Salesforce org, the child object must already exist in the target org.</li>\n</ul>
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistSectionChildRelation	Child Relationships
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistTitle	Deployment Checklist
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentChecklistValidationRule	The following Validation Rules can be migrated to the target objects under the following conditions:\n<br/><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>There must be target field mappings defined for each field referenced in the formula.</li>\n<li>The formula does not make use of custom field relationships (i.e. "__r") referencing cross object fields.</li>\n</ul>\nValidation Rules must meet these conditions or will not be included in the deployment package and will need to be manually reviewed with the assistance of an expert.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__DeploymentPackageProcessing	Generating deployment package, please wait or come back later
