CustomLabel.omnistudio__Description	Description
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile1	Your internal Salesforce users can author surveys, send surveys, manage surveys, respond to surveys, and report on survey data. You can control which users can access SurveyVista.
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile2	To collect survey responses from your external users such as your partners/customers or from unauthenticated users, you will require to configure a Salesforce Digital Experience Site and associate the site with your Survey.
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile3	In order to allow unauthenticated users to respond to a survey, you need to grant permissions to Ardira Survey objects to the Guest User.
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile4	To collect responses from Salesforce Digital Experience Site members (aka community/portal users),Assign “Ardira Survey Responder - Community User” permission set to each community user.
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile5	You can expose the SurveyVista “Surveys” related list in a record detail page of an object (such as Contact, Case, and a custom object) by creating a lookup field in Survey Result to the object.
CustomLabel.ArdiraSurvey__Description_of_Tile6	To initialize your trial with sample data, click the Load Sample Data..
