CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisEncryption	The Financial Services Cloud Transition Assistant scans metadata only, such as field labels, and not actual field data values in your Salesforce org. As part of your transition to Financial Services Cloud, we recommend that you analyze these fields that have encryption enabled.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisHeadingEncryption	Encryption
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisHeadingFieldAudit	Field Audit
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisIntro	Here is an analysis of objects that contain fields utilizing Field History Tracking and Field Audit.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisTracking	As a reminder the Financial Services Cloud transition tool only scans metadata and not actual data values in your Salesforce org. For example, the field label is metadata and the value in that field is actual data. We have provided the below fields which have metadata indicating that they have Field History Tracking and/or Field Auditing enabled. This is provided as an additional data point for you to analyze as part of your transition to Financial Services Cloud.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__FieldAnalysisTrackingDisclaimer	Field history can <a href="https://help.salesforce.com/s/articleView?id=000332229&type=1">not be migrated</a> to a new org or moved to a new object. To meet regulatory requirements additional solutions may be required.
