CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpAdvancedClaimMgmt	Are claim participants stored, are claims related to the relevant coverage of the insurance policy, are claim payments tracked?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpAdvancedPolicyLI	Gives insurance carriers a system of record and management tools to rate policyholders, quote premiums, and bind, issue, and renew policies: CommissionSchedule, CommissionScheduleAssignment, InsurancePolicySurcharge, ProducerCommission, InsurancePolicyTransaction
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpAdvancedPolicyPC	Gives insurance carriers a system of record and management tools to rate policyholders, quote premiums, and bind, issue, and renew policies: CommissionSchedule, CommissionScheduleAssignment, InsurancePolicySurcharge, ProducerCommission, InsurancePolicyTransaction, LegalEntity, DistributorAuthorization, AuthorizedInsuranceLine
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpAssets	Are the assets of your customers stored (regardless of whether or not they are insured)?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpBrokerHierarchy	Is the corporate structure of the broker organization stored?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpBusinessEntities	A business entity is a group which allows you to associate businesses and legal entities. Example: Parent company with subsidiary companies.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpClaimData	Is claim information stored in Salesforce? Examples: auto, life, or home claims data/information.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpClaimItems	Do you store claim item data? Claim item data represents information pertaining to collision damage, roadside assistance, rental care, etc and their coverage details.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpClaimMultipleAssets	Are separate claim items stored on 1 claim (collision damage, roadside assistance, rental care, etc) and is it related back to relevant coverage items on the claim?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpCoverages	Represents the type of coverage, such as liability, earthquake, or collision damage. You see this object only if you have enabled the "Access Master List of Coverage Types" org pref.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpDistributionModel	How are the policies sold to the end customer: direct OR via captive agents or independent brokers.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpEndCustomer	A person (B2C) or organization (B2B) that does business with your firm (owns the policy) in the past, present, or future.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__HelpEndCustomerHouseholds	A household is a group which allows you to relate people to a household, household members to external contacts, and a household to external contacts and accounts.
