CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipDataSource	Element Name or path to the node-for example ContextId.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipFieldNameName	Language-independent value written to Data JSON.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipFieldNameValue	Displayed on OmniScript UI.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipFilterValue	Can be an OmniScript Element (e.g., ContextId) or field from an earlier queried JSON Path (e.g., Contact:AccountId)
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipInputParam	The Element name(s) or node(s) from the OmniScript that will be used to perform the lookup.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipInvokeModeIP	<p class="items">  <strong>Default</strong>:  Action blocks the UI.</p><p class="items">  <strong>Non-Blocking</strong>:  Action runs asynchronously with response applied to UI. Pre and Post Data Mapper Transforms, large attachments, and chainable mode not supported.</p><p class="items">  <strong class="block">Fire and Forget:</strong>  Action runs asynchronously with no callback to UI. Pre and Post Data Mapper Transforms, large attachments, and chainable mode not supported.</p>
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipInvokeModeRemote	<p class="items">  <strong>Default</strong>:  Action blocks the UI.</p><p class="items">  <strong>Non-Blocking</strong>:  Action runs asynchronously with response applied to UI. Pre and Post Data Mapper Transforms and large attachments not supported.</p><p class="items">  <strong class="block">Fire and Forget:</strong>  Action runs asynchronously with no callback to UI. Pre and Post Data Mapper Transforms and large attachments not supported.</p>
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipJsonPath	The results of the lookup query are inserted into this user-defined key. Vlocity recommends using the Lookup Object Name-for example, Contact or, if related, nest the object under its parent, for example, Contact:Account.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipJsonPathFieldNameName	JSON path to the field that will map to the language-independent field value referenced by the OmniScript Data JSON.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipJsonPathFieldNameValue	JSON path to the field that will map to the field label that displays on the OmniScript UI.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipKnowledgeFieldVal	The contents of these fields are displayed when a Knowledge article is opened inside the OmniScript or modal. Fields should be comma-separated, with no spaces (e.g. Summary,Body__c)
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipLightningOnly	If unchecked, the label is shown inside the field.  If checked, the label is shown above the field. Lightning Player only.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipLookupObjectName	The Object and Field Name on the domain that equals the Filter Value-for example, Contact.Id
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipLookupQryCfg	The lookup query (SELECT Lookup Object WHERE Lookup Object.Field Name = Filter Value) and JSON Path for the results of the query.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipPopulate	The Lookup Element is a dropdown and requires a language-independent value field and language dependent label field, which is displayed on the script.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipSavePattern	<p><b>Field API Name</b>: enter the custom field API Name located in the Saved OmniScript object.<br><b>URL Pattern</b>: enter the resume link. Replace the OmniScript Instance ID with <em>{0}</em><br><b>Example</b>: https://c.gus.visual.force.com/apex/OmniScriptMobilePage?layout=lightning#/OS/{0}/scriptState/saveAndResume/true/true</p>
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTipVFPagesInPreview	Key: Page name as it should appear in the Preview dropdown menu\nValue: link to the VF page using the format VFPageName?verticalMode\nExample: c__myVFPage?verticalMode=true (page with no name space prefix)\nns__myVFPage?verticalMode=true (page with name space prefix ns)
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTypePatternMismatch	Enter a value that begins with a letter, contains only underscores and alphanumeric characters. Exclude spaces, consecutive underscores and an underscore at the end.
CustomLabel.omnistudio__OmniDesTypePatternMismatchApi	Enter a value that starts with a letter and contains only alphanumeric characters without spaces or underscores.
