CustomLabel.FSCTransition__PackageDescriptionFSCExt	The unmanaged extension package provides field sets that configure how fields display in the client and household profiles.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__PackageDescriptionFSCExtCommercial	The unmanaged commercial banking extension package provides the commercial banking dashboard.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__PackageDescriptionFSCExtReferral	The unmanaged referral package provides the retail banking dashboard.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__PackageDescriptionFSCFlow	These sets of flows include mortgage, insurance, and retail banking flows. With Financial Services Cloud, you get the mortgage flows, by default. However, to get the insurance and retail banking flows, you must install the Lightning Flow for Financial Services Cloud package. The flows are installed as standard flow templates. You can clone the templates to customize them according to your business processes. <a href="https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.financial_services_cloud_admin_guide.meta/financial_services_cloud_admin_guide/fsc_flows.htm">More Information</a>\nNOTE: This package requires Person Accounts to be enabled
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__PackageDescriptionFinancialServicesCloud	The managed package contains most of the Financial Services Cloud functionality. This functionality includes custom fields and objects, list views and profiles of clients and households, and administrative configurations. <a href="https://www.salesforce.com/form/industries/financialservices-demo-form">FSC Demo</a>
