CustomLabel.FSCTransition__RecInsurancePolicyRecordTypeMapping	In FSC, insurance policy types — for example, home, auto, annuity, or life — are not represented by distinct Insurance Policy record types.  Instead, the type of the insurance policy is determined by the Policy Type picklist field.  All functionality or automated processes that reference policy types should be carefully reviewed by a developer to determine the best approach for conversion whereupon the Policy Type picklist field will be utilized in place of record types.
