CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeAccelerate	Learn new skills from anywhere on Trailhead
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeAccelerateHeader	Accelerate Your Path to Success
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeHowToUse	The report will give you some peace of mind seeing what a FSC transition entails before committing. The tool is without bias and calibrates your org against others in the same industry. The goal of the report is to produce a foundation for estimating your transition effort, evaluate possible automation of the transition and help you focus on items that require careful planning.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeHowToUseHeader	How Do I Use This Report?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeImpactScaleApproval	This icon indicates a section that is ready to be transitioned with little to no change required.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeImpactScaleClose	This icon indicates a problem of some sort, possibly pointing to items that will prevent a successful transition if not fixed.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeImpactScaleHeader	Impact Scale
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeImpactScaleSolution	This icon indicates informational text for your transition, often pointing out information that will be useful in preparation to transition.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeImpactScaleWarning	This icon indicates something to be aware of, changes that should be made before transition, or items that might be problematic if not addressed.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLearnFromOthers	Join the community - Learn, connect, have fun, and give back together
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLearnFromOthersHeader	Learn From Others
