CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLinkFSCText	Join the conversation here to ask questions, get answers, stay updated.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLinkFSCUserGroup	Financial Services User Group
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLinkFSCUserGroupText	Where the FinServ community collaborates and explores new ideas.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLinkWorkInFSC	Learn to Work in Financial Services Cloud
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeLinkWorkInFSCText	A comprehensive view of your customers so you can better meet their needs.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeWhatsIn	This document outlines the recommendations for Financial Services Cloud (FSC) transition. It is meant for existing Sales and Service Cloud customers who are looking to implement FSC. Customers with other license type may have additional changes to take care of.
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeWhatsInHeader	What's In This Report?
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__ReportSummaryWelcomeWhatsInNote	Note: If a report runs in the org with no data, the tool will only produce evaluation of meta data.
