CustomLabel.FSCTransition__WelcomeParagraph1	<p>Welcome to the <b>Financial Services Cloud Transition Assistant</b> - a tool designed to plan and simplify your migration from Sales Cloud or Service Cloud to our purpose-built, trusted product for Financial Services: <b>Financial Services Cloud!</b></p><br/>\n<p>By taking the time to migrate to Financial Services Cloud, you are making an investment in the future of your business. Financial Services Cloud extends the power of the Salesforce Platform and includes industry-specific features for retail banking, wealth, and insurance to allow for:</p>
CustomLabel.FSCTransition__WelcomeParagraph2	<p>The Financial Services Cloud Transition Assistant is a free managed package, created by Salesforce experts, to do some of the heavy lifting in helping customers migrate to Financial Services Cloud.</p><br/>\n<p>For help on using the tool, refer to the <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YqZGmZWkAYUfyfBQlAWBRzJg2SvWCupdDZfxuvmM23I/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank">Financial Services Cloud Transition Assistant User Guide</a>.</p>
